// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'id'
//
// Two embedded-data types, one letter apart, with incompatible payloads. `Relational` takes
// QUOTED csv -- `rows: STRING ('+' STRING)*` -- while `Relation` takes UNQUOTED inline csv
// lexed cell by cell in a dedicated lexer mode. This file gives Relational the Relation
// payload.
//
// Note the asymmetry, which is why this fixture points this way round: the other direction
// is ACCEPTED. A `Relation` island handed quoted-csv text lexes the quotes as ordinary cell
// characters and yields a table with nonsense column names, so only this direction is
// pinnable.
###Data
Data fixture::neg::RelationalUnquotedCsv
{
   fixture::neg::Db:
      Relational
      #{
         default.PERSON:
            id, name
            1 , Ada;
      }#;
}
